=\"_blank\">here</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-02T16:20:58-08:00","id":1352242,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1107-maryshelly\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1107_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1107\" data-vbnamecard=\"1107\">maryshelly</a> I\u2019m looking forward to it too. Let me know how it is if you get it before me?<br /> <br /> General question: what do you guys think of The Unbidden, the Night Horrors book for First Ed Mage?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-02T16:52:03-08:00","id":1352248,"title":"","content":"Good but probably one of the more dated ones. A <i>lot </i>of nice ideas, mechanics could use fixing up if you want to bring them into second edition and make them fitting antagonists. I believe it was written before Left-Hand Path and it doesn't seem like the ideas for scelesti and other folks you might run into in Nameless and Accursed were fleshed out","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 12-02-2019, 07:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofa